<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include "partials/head.njk" %}
</head>
<body>

{% include "partials/header.njk" %}

<main class="membership-page">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="membership-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Become a Lion</span>
      <h1>Make a difference right here at home.</h1>
      <p>
        Our community is stronger when neighbors come together.
        Join the Skowhegan Lions Club and help make a positive
        difference in the lives of others.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Ask About Membership</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Introduction -->
  <section class="membership-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="membership-intro-content">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">More Than Membership</span>
        <h2>There's a place for you in our club.</h2>
        <p>
          Lions are people who care about their communities and
          are willing to lend a helping hand. We bring together
          people from different backgrounds who share a common
          desire to serve others.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you have a little time to give or want to become
          more involved, your ideas, experience, and enthusiasm
          can make a difference.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Benefits -->
  <section class="membership-benefits">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="membership-heading">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Why Become a Lion?</span>
        <h2>Good things happen when we serve together.</h2>
        <p>
          Being part of the Skowhegan Lions Club is an opportunity
          to help others while building friendships and connections.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="membership-benefit-grid">

        <article class="membership-benefit-card">
          <div class="membership-benefit-icon">♡</div>
          <h3>Help Your Community</h3>
          <p>
            Support local residents, assist families, and take part
            in projects that make a meaningful difference in the
            Skowhegan area.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="membership-benefit-card">
          <div class="membership-benefit-icon">✦</div>
          <h3>Build Friendships</h3>
          <p>
            Meet people who share your interest in helping others
            and develop lasting friendships through service.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="membership-benefit-card">
          <div class="membership-benefit-icon">◎</div>
          <h3>Make an Impact</h3>
          <p>
            Take part in vision assistance, scholarships,
            community activities, and other worthwhile efforts.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="membership-benefit-card">
          <div class="membership-benefit-icon">☆</div>
          <h3>Grow as a Volunteer</h3>
          <p>
            Share your talents, learn new skills, develop
            leadership experience, and discover new ways to serve.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Leadership Development -->
  <section class="membership-leadership">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="leadership-intro">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Grow as a Leader</span>
        <h2>Discover your leadership potential.</h2>
        <p>
          Lions membership offers more than the opportunity to serve.
          It can also open doors to personal growth, leadership
          development, and opportunities to make an impact on a much
          larger scale.
        </p>
        <p>
          Members can develop their skills, take on new responsibilities,
          and grow into leadership positions within the club, across
          their district, and throughout Lions Clubs International.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="leadership-path">

        <article class="leadership-card">
          <span class="leadership-level">01</span>
          <h3>Club Leadership</h3>
          <p>
            Begin by serving your local club. Members can take on
            committee responsibilities and eventually serve as
            club officers, including secretary, treasurer, or
            club president.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="leadership-card">
          <span class="leadership-level">02</span>
          <h3>Zone Leadership</h3>
          <p>
            Expand your involvement by working with multiple clubs
            in your area. Zone leadership offers the opportunity
            to support club success, encourage collaboration, and
            help develop other Lions.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="leadership-card">
          <span class="leadership-level">03</span>
          <h3>District Leadership</h3>
          <p>
            Take on a broader leadership role by serving at the
            district level. Experienced Lions can pursue positions
            such as district governor, helping guide clubs and
            advance service throughout their district.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="leadership-card">
          <span class="leadership-level">04</span>
          <h3>Leadership Beyond the District</h3>
          <p>
            For those who want to go further, Lions offers
            opportunities for leadership at the multiple-district,
            national, and international levels. Your leadership
            journey can reach far beyond your hometown.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="leadership-note">
        <h3>Leadership begins with a willingness to serve.</h3>
        <p>
          You don't need to be an experienced leader to become a Lion.
          Lions provides opportunities to learn, grow, and develop
          along the way.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How to Join -->
  <section class="membership-steps">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="membership-heading">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Getting Started</span>
        <h2>How to become a Skowhegan Lion.</h2>
        <p>
          Getting involved is easy. Start by reaching out and
          getting to know our club.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="membership-step-grid">

        <article class="membership-step">
          <span class="step-number">01</span>
          <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
          <p>
            Contact us and let us know you're interested in
            learning more about the Skowhegan Lions Club.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="membership-step">
          <span class="step-number">02</span>
          <h3>Meet Our Members</h3>
          <p>
            Come meet our members, ask questions, and learn about
            our activities. You're welcome to get a feel for the
            club before deciding to join.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="membership-step">
          <span class="step-number">03</span>
          <h3>Become Involved</h3>
          <p>
            Explore membership with the club and discover how
            you can contribute your time and talents to our
            community.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Call to Action -->
  <section class="membership-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Your Community Needs You</span>
      <h2>Ready to make a difference?</h2>
      <p>
        We'd be happy to answer your questions and tell you more
        about becoming a member of the Skowhegan Lions Club.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us About Joining</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
